# Coins of Magic (Q336), the membership run: a level 40 character holding twenty-one gold wyverns
# and one of each coin but the gold knight of the third grade's upgrade set accepts at Sorint and
# takes the diagram, and Bernard sends it hunting. An antelope drops no coin before the
# membership; a Harit lizardman shaman drops the Kaldis gold dragon (rolls 0 0), which Sorint
# takes for the third grade membership. An antelope then drops a gold wyvern (rolls 0 0). Lorain
# trades ten wyverns for a gold knight at the fixed rate, then plays two games: four wyverns on two
# tries, won at the first guess (coins rolled 0 0 0), and eight wyverns on three tries, one then
# two coins right, then the hidden coins shown (rolled 1 2 0). Sorint raises the membership to the
# second grade and asks for the first grade's set, whose page does not load (it is not valid
# UTF-8); Pano, a first grade collector, has nothing for a second grade member. Sorint ends the
# repeatable quest; then relog. Expectations replay the reference trace of this scenario.
trace internal/gameserver/script/testdata/oracle/scenarios/q336_coins_of_magic.golden
character Collector 40
hold 3482 21
hold 3473 1
hold 3475 1
hold 3485 1
hold 3491 1
hold 3494 1
random 0 0 0 0 0 0 0 1 2 0
script quest.Q336_CoinsOfMagic
